  "end_summary": "Added a shared assertLabelHasNoLeadingSigil helper (src/tickets/labels.ts), used by both new's buildNewTicket (rejects any --label starting with +/-) and update's parseLabelOp (rejects a doubled sigil after its own op sigil is stripped, e.g. --label ++bug). Both now agree on what a valid label looks like, closing the grammar mismatch where new silently stored a literal '+bug'/'-weird' label that a later update --label could never correctly address. Updated the B1.test.ts test that had documented the old accept-silently behavior.",
